==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Hippoe]]s spawn after 0.67 seconds<sup>20f</sup>, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
*5 [[Zomboe]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Hyppoh]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*1 [[Super Metal Hippoe]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*2 [[Capy|Capies]] spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.
*2 [[Mini White Cyclone]]s spawn after 56.67 seconds<sup>1,700f</sup>, delay 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Koronium]] spawns after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
You can rush this stage by killing the first Hippoe, then prevent the enemies from exiting their base by using a high defense unit such as [[Curling Cat (Rare Cat)|Green Shell Cat]] while rushing their base by using fast and high DPS units like [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] or [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]].

==Trivia==
*Undertow Coast's Japanese name, Ōshio no Nagisa (大潮の渚, "Spring Tide Shore"), may be a pun on the late film director and screenwriter [[wikipedia:Nagisa Oshima|Nagisa Oshima]] (大島 渚), known as Ōshima Nagisa in Japanese.

